 * POS card-slip OCR (F-RCP-005…011, R-188, D-006, D-077, T-123): vision LLM
 * extraction FIRST, then the image is stored on the PRIVATE receipts disk
 * (no orphans), values validated, duplicates (SEQ+AUTH+amount) refused,
